 xbmc/windowing/gbm/WinSystemGbm.cpp      | 190 ++++++++++++++++++++++-
 xbmc/windowing/gbm/WinSystemGbm.h        |  14 ++
 xbmc/windowing/gbm/drm/DVBridgeState.cpp |   4 +-
